WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:07.283 --> 00:00:10.353
Jill, as you know, the Kremlin

00:00:10.486 --> 00:00:11.854
now says the criminal case

00:00:11.988 --> 00:00:13.056
against prigozhin will be

00:00:13.189 --> 00:00:13.523
dropped.

00:00:13.523 --> 00:00:14.757
What does all this reveal about

00:00:14.891 --> 00:00:18.661
Vladimir Putin's grasp on power

00:00:18.795 --> 00:00:19.562
right now?

00:00:19.696 --> 00:00:20.997
&gt;&gt; Well, I still think that he

00:00:21.130 --> 00:00:23.066
is in a very weakened position

00:00:23.199 --> 00:00:25.101
after this -- I mean, after, you

00:00:25.234 --> 00:00:26.869
know, a rebellion, almost

00:00:27.003 --> 00:00:27.670
getting to Moscow.

00:00:27.804 --> 00:00:30.340
There's no question.

00:00:30.340 --> 00:00:31.341
And he's also left with this

00:00:31.474 --> 00:00:35.278
dilemma of what do you do with

00:00:35.411 --> 00:00:35.911
prigozhin.

00:00:35.945 --> 00:00:37.980
Prigozhin is a time bomb, and

00:00:38.348 --> 00:00:38.981
they know it.

00:00:39.115 --> 00:00:40.983
So this idea that you get him

00:00:41.117 --> 00:00:43.486
out of Russia, you send him to

00:00:43.619 --> 00:00:45.421
Belarus, it sounds a little

00:00:45.555 --> 00:00:47.890
strange, but I cannot imagine

00:00:48.024 --> 00:00:50.593
that prigozhin would continue to

00:00:50.727 --> 00:00:52.362
be in Russia because every day

00:00:52.362 --> 00:00:53.730
that he's there he's a potential

00:00:53.863 --> 00:00:54.364
threat.

00:00:54.364 --> 00:00:56.366
I mean, what prigozhin wants is

00:00:56.366 --> 00:00:58.668
to get rid of the leadership of

00:00:58.801 --> 00:00:59.402
the military.

00:00:59.535 --> 00:01:02.372
Does he want Putin to go?

00:01:02.405 --> 00:01:03.206
Not necessarily.

00:01:03.339 --> 00:01:06.042
But he's been very critical in

00:01:06.376 --> 00:01:07.810
effect by saying what he said,

00:01:07.944 --> 00:01:11.748
that Putin was misled by his

00:01:11.881 --> 00:01:12.382
military.

00:01:12.382 --> 00:01:13.549
So it is a very confusing

00:01:13.683 --> 00:01:15.918
situation, but I think -- I was

00:01:16.052 --> 00:01:19.622
asking myself why would they let

00:01:19.756 --> 00:01:20.456
lukashenko do this deal.

00:01:20.590 --> 00:01:24.394
And I do think that if Putin

00:01:24.394 --> 00:01:26.396
were to negotiate directly with

00:01:26.396 --> 00:01:28.398
prigozhin, it would put them on

00:01:28.464 --> 00:01:30.633
the same level.

00:01:30.767 --> 00:01:32.402
Vladimir Putin could never do

00:01:32.402 --> 00:01:33.269
that.

00:01:33.403 --> 00:01:35.438
He gets lukashenko who owes him

00:01:35.571 --> 00:01:37.106
a lot to do the deal.

00:01:37.240 --> 00:01:37.940
It leaves questions.

00:01:38.074 --> 00:01:42.078
Does Wagner disband?

00:01:42.412 --> 00:01:43.513
Where do they go?

00:01:43.646 --> 00:01:45.848
Do they go back to fight?

00:01:45.982 --> 00:01:47.917
Do they exist?

00:01:48.050 --> 00:01:50.019
What happened to the lucrative

00:01:50.420 --> 00:01:52.422
business prigozhin had from

00:01:52.555 --> 00:01:53.055
Wagner?

00:01:53.089 --> 00:01:54.424
It's quite extraordinary.

00:01:54.557 --> 00:01:55.958
&gt;&gt; Lots of questions unfolding

00:01:56.092 --> 00:01:56.426
now.

00:01:56.426 --> 00:01:57.693
General hurtling, how incredible

00:01:57.827 --> 00:01:59.328
is it that this power struggle

00:01:59.462 --> 00:02:00.430
between the Russian military on

00:02:00.496 --> 00:02:02.432
the one hand and prigozhin and

00:02:02.432 --> 00:02:08.438
his Wagner troops spiralled this

00:02:08.438 --> 00:02:10.039
far?
&gt;&gt; Wolf, that is a great

00:02:10.440 --> 00:02:13.009
question.
What's fascinating, in all

00:02:13.142 --> 00:02:13.776
organizational militaries you

00:02:13.910 --> 00:02:15.178
have unique personalities.

00:02:15.311 --> 00:02:18.514
Some with a lot of ego.

00:02:18.648 --> 00:02:22.118
As Jill mentioned, prigozhin is

00:02:22.452 --> 00:02:25.655
not just a time bomb, but he's a

00:02:25.788 --> 00:02:26.722
free-floating electron.

00:02:26.856 --> 00:02:27.857
He's all over the place.

00:02:27.990 --> 00:02:30.460
What you're talking about with

00:02:30.460 --> 00:02:33.296
prigozhin and schoygu, neither

00:02:33.429 --> 00:02:34.831
are professional military men.

00:02:34.964 --> 00:02:36.699
They have not grown up in the

00:02:36.833 --> 00:02:37.200
military.

00:02:37.200 --> 00:02:39.001
They're play acting in this.

00:02:39.135 --> 00:02:40.670
They have not subjugated their

00:02:40.803 --> 00:02:42.638
forces to the security of

00:02:42.772 --> 00:02:43.105
Russia.

00:02:43.105 --> 00:02:44.574
They have forces that are

00:02:44.707 --> 00:02:45.675
pledged to them.

00:02:45.808 --> 00:02:46.709
It's phenomenal.

00:02:46.843 --> 00:02:48.611
I was thinking as I was watching

00:02:48.744 --> 00:02:50.480
the film, some of which you're

00:02:50.480 --> 00:02:52.081
showing right now, the soldiers

00:02:52.482 --> 00:02:53.716
that are walking around as part

00:02:53.850 --> 00:02:58.154
of the Wagner group under

00:02:58.488 --> 00:02:59.021
prigozhin's command, what the

00:02:59.155 --> 00:03:00.690
legislation they thinking now?

00:03:00.823 --> 00:03:01.824
What's their mission?

00:03:01.958 --> 00:03:02.859
What's their mission set?

00:03:02.992 --> 00:03:04.093
It certainly not to serve

00:03:04.494 --> 00:03:06.496
Russia.
It's to serve this personality.

00:03:06.496 --> 00:03:08.965
And the ego is off the chart.

00:03:09.098 --> 00:03:10.500
It's narcissistic.

00:03:10.500 --> 00:03:12.502
And truthfully, there are a lot

00:03:12.502 --> 00:03:14.036
of losers from what occurred

00:03:14.170 --> 00:03:15.805
over the last 24 hours.

00:03:15.938 --> 00:03:17.507
There will be continued losers,

00:03:17.640 --> 00:03:21.577
and I believe both Putin,

00:03:21.711 --> 00:03:23.312
shoygu, and prigozhin are all

00:03:23.446 --> 00:03:25.281
losers in this outcome.

00:03:25.414 --> 00:03:27.083
&gt;&gt; You're an expert in this

00:03:27.216 --> 00:03:28.985
whole area, Dimitri.

00:03:29.118 --> 00:03:30.019
What do you think?

00:03:30.152 --> 00:03:31.521
&gt;&gt; I absolutely agree.

00:03:31.654 --> 00:03:35.958
The fact that prigozhin's

00:03:36.092 --> 00:03:38.694
armored column was able to reach

00:03:38.828 --> 00:03:40.530
150 miles of Moscow without the

00:03:40.630 --> 00:03:42.098
combined forces of the Russian

00:03:42.532 --> 00:03:46.903
minutesview of defense, forces

00:03:47.036 --> 00:03:48.538
of the sfb and National Guard

00:03:48.571 --> 00:03:49.839
being able to stop them is

00:03:49.972 --> 00:03:50.806
remarkable and indicates how

00:03:50.940 --> 00:03:53.142
weak the whole system has

00:03:53.276 --> 00:03:53.609
become.

00:03:53.609 --> 00:03:55.444
I mean, this is almost --

00:03:55.578 --> 00:03:56.646
they've reached as far as hitler

00:03:56.779 --> 00:03:59.081
did in 1941 right on the

00:03:59.215 --> 00:04:00.550
outskirts of Moscow.

00:04:00.550 --> 00:04:02.051
Truly remarkable, and even after

00:04:02.184 --> 00:04:04.053
Putin had declared that these

00:04:04.186 --> 00:04:05.755
traders have to be crushed, the

00:04:05.888 --> 00:04:06.923
Russian military still was

00:04:07.056 --> 00:04:08.558
unable to stop them.

00:04:08.558 --> 00:04:10.826
&gt;&gt; You think he should,

00:04:10.960 --> 00:04:11.761
prigozhin, should fear for his

00:04:11.894 --> 00:04:15.231
life right now?

00:04:15.364 --> 00:04:17.500
&gt;&gt; I think it's too early to

00:04:17.633 --> 00:04:18.034
say.

00:04:18.034 --> 00:04:19.468
This deal may very well hold.

00:04:19.602 --> 00:04:21.170
In fact, the right way to think

00:04:21.304 --> 00:04:23.339
about the Russian system in

00:04:23.472 --> 00:04:25.274
general is for those of you who

00:04:25.408 --> 00:04:27.643
like the "Godfather" movie, it's

00:04:27.777 --> 00:04:30.580
as if the barcini crime family

00:04:30.580 --> 00:04:36.586
negotiated a deal between veto

00:04:36.619 --> 00:04:37.687
corleoni and the family.

00:04:37.820 --> 00:04:39.322
These are mafia figures, and

00:04:39.455 --> 00:04:42.592
sometimes in mafia gangland

00:04:42.592 --> 00:04:48.598
shootouts, what's known in

